---
source: tests/help.rs
expression: help(&path)
---
Save a snapshot of the sandbox as a template

Usage: bento template save [OPTIONS] <SANDBOX> <TAG>

Arguments:
  <SANDBOX>
          Sandbox to save

  <TAG>
          Template name, e.g. myimage:v1.0

Options:
  -D, --debug
          Enable debug logging: each smolvm call, and SMOLBENTO_LOG at info unless set

      --no-input
          Never prompt; commands that need an answer fail with the command to run instead

  -o, --output <OUTPUT>
          Also export the template to a file

  -h, --help
          Print help
